{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026baQuTwqjru1794363797.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>「TVB節目巡禮2027」昨日（10日）盛大舉行，會上震撼公布8大重點劇集名單，包括《驅魔速遞》、《超時空男臣II》、《警是個大佬》、《模仿人生》、《枱底》、《模範律師團》、《新聞女王III》及《金枝慾孽之宮牆折柳（豎屏短劇）》。</p><p><p><img alt=\"0d2d752a-4c60-4202-9fe1-97fd3d91ff8a.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026EmXkaJk82o1794363794.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"ab008ca6-c798-460f-add8-40362211f161.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BoruFmQQuM1794363795.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>其中，由周嘉洛、陳曉華、吳偉豪、戴祖儀及丁子朗主演的奇幻新劇《驅魔速遞》主打視覺衝擊，全員「打到飛起」！陳曉華飾演冷艷驅魔人「霍冰冰」，憑藉俐落的招牌飛踢腿展現強大氣場，劇中不僅與周嘉洛展開激戰，更在關鍵時刻捨身擋擊。除了緊張大膽的CG打鬥外，感情線亦相當吸睛，戴祖儀與吳偉豪上演激情「夾腰吻」，周嘉洛與陳曉華亦有深情對視與虐心喊戲，扣緊「一念成人，一念成魔」的核心主題。</p><p><p><img alt=\"61507339-7783-4690-84ef-f00deeb40825.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026t6M5JMJ9E91794363796.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"dfda9aef-e901-4811-b1e5-46ecaa2f30d7.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zVEk17OC621794363796.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>另一矚目焦點為相隔10年重磅回歸的《超時空男臣II》，「男臣三兄弟」蕭正楠、曹永廉及何廣沛再度合體。三人用三支吸管共飲一杯「鴨屎香檸檬茶」，神同步第一輯齊舔雪糕的經典名場面，瞬間掀起觀眾回憶殺；宣傳片尾段氣氛更突然轉暗，神秘人一句「400年終於等到你返嚟！」，預告跨越四個世紀的宿命大戰即將爆發。</p><p><p><img alt=\"7e65cc54-3a73-492f-b41d-ccd3ba66d5d1.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026VXEEtvDq1b1794363793.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"5bbf7ff0-f248-4af0-8544-5e89b960bc2a.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026LP2bw8GQEo1794363794.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>此外，由林盛斌、羅子溢、王敏奕、容天佑、傅嘉莉及賴慰玲攜手主演的《警是個大佬》，亦宣佈定檔於12月14日登陸翡翠台播映。</p><h2></h2></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T03:11:11.599304+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":512,"images":7,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T02:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T11:10:23.684245+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T03:04:37.868868+00:00","content_hash":"a1686f1b98ee945d88d47ede486aa048c37faadadeea19c71b36d6084d2c9108","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T03:11:11.599304+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}